@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5119

### Health Check Endpoint
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Echo Endpoint
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello, World!",
  "user": "Adrian"
}

###

### Auth - Signup
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123!"
}

###

### Auth - Signin
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123!"
}

###

### Auth - Session
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/session
Accept: application/json

###

### Auth - Signout
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signout
